  "items": [
    {
      "source": "<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> backed <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/web/util/matcher/RequestMatcher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.web.util.matcher\"><code>RequestMatcher</code></a>. Can work directly with the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>, obtain an existing bean or\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/AutowireCapableBeanFactory.html#createBean(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>create a new bean</code></a> that is\nautowired in the usual way.",
      "translation": "由 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>` 支持的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/web/util/matcher/RequestMatcher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.web.util.matcher\"><code>RequestMatcher</code></a>`。可以直接与 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>` 配合使用，获取现有 Bean 或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/AutowireCapableBeanFactory.html#createBean(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>创建新 Bean</code></a>，该 Bean 将以通常的方式进行自动装配。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns if the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a> should be ignored and not used for\nmatching. If this method returns <code>true</code> then the context will not be used and\nthe <a href=\"#matches(jakarta.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest)\"><code>matches</code></a> method will return <code>false</code>.",
      "translation": "如果返回 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a>` 是否应被忽略且不可用于匹配。如果此方法返回 `<code>true</code>`，则不会使用该上下文，并且 <a href=\"#matches(jakarta.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest)\"><code>matches</code></a>` 方法将返回 `<code>false</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Method that can be implemented by subclasses that wish to initialize items the\nfirst time that the matcher is called. This method will be called only once and\nonly if <a href=\"#ignoreApplicationContext(org.springframework.web.context.WebApplicationContext)\"><code>ignoreApplicationContext(WebApplicationContext)</code></a> returns\n<code>false</code>. Note that the supplied context will be based on the\n<strong>first</strong> request sent to the matcher.",
      "translation": "子类可以实现的用于在首次调用匹配器时初始化项目的方法。此方法仅会被调用一次，且仅在 <a href=\"#ignoreApplicationContext(org.springframework.web.context.WebApplicationContext)\"><code>ignoreApplicationContext(WebApplicationContext)</code></a> 返回<code>false</code> 时才会被调用。请注意，提供的上下文将基于发送到匹配器的<strong>第一个</strong>请求。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Decides whether the rule implemented by the strategy matches the supplied request.",
      "translation": "决定由策略实现的规则是否与提供的请求匹配。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/web/util/matcher/RequestMatcher.html#matches(jakarta.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.web.util.matcher\">matches</a></code> in interface <code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/web/util/matcher/RequestMatcher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.web.util.matcher\">RequestMatcher</a></code>",
      "translation": "`<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/web/util/matcher/RequestMatcher.html#matches(jakarta.servlet.http.HttpServletRequest)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.web.util.matcher\">matches</a></code>` 接口 `<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-security/site/docs/7.0.x/api/org/springframework/security/web/util/matcher/RequestMatcher.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.security.web.util.matcher\">RequestMatcher</a></code>` 中",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>webApplicationContext</code> - the candidate web application context",
      "translation": "<code>webApplicationContext</code> - 候选 Web 应用程序上下文",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>context</code> - a supplier for the initialized context (may throw an exception)",
      "translation": "<code>context</code> - 初始化上下文的提供者（可能会抛出异常）",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns if the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a> should be ignored and not used for\nmatching.",
      "translation": "如果应忽略 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/context/WebApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.context\"><code>WebApplicationContext</code></a>` 且不用于匹配，则返回 true。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Method that can be implemented by subclasses that wish to initialize items the\nfirst time that the matcher is called.",
      "translation": "子类可以在首次调用匹配器时初始化项目，可由此实现的方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span id=\"type-param-C\"><code>C</code> - the type of the context that the match method actually needs to use. Can be\nan <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> or a class of an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html#getBean(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>existing bean</code></a>.</span>",
      "translation": "<span id=\"type-param-C\"><code>C</code> - 匹配方法实际需要使用的上下文类型。可以是 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> 或一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html#getBean(java.lang.Class)\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>现有 Bean</code></a> 的类。</span>",
      "count": 1
    },
